message: "If you use KinForm, please cite the software and the associated preprint."
title: "KinForm: Kinetics-Informed Feature Optimised Representation Models for Enzyme kcat and KM Prediction"
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-03-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/Digital-Metabolic-Twin-Centre/KinForm"
url: "https://github.com/Digital-Metabolic-Twin-Centre/KinForm"
abstract: >-
  KinForm is a research software repository for predicting enzyme kinetic
  parameters from protein sequence and substrate SMILES using protein language
  model embeddings, binding-site-aware pooling, dimensionality reduction, and
  tree-based machine learning models.
keywords:
  - enzyme kinetics
  - kcat
  - KM
  - protein language models
  - bioinformatics
  - cheminformatics
